 n the sandstone lighthouse on Barrenjoey Head.\n\nWHEN (Sydney time)\nMond
 ay 22 March 2027  (work day)\nFull moon: Mon 22 Mar 21:43. Moon 100% lit a
 t the alignment.\nSunset 19:04 · civil twilight ends 19:28\nMoonrise 18:4
 4 at azimuth 93° E (sea level horizon).\nALIGNMENT 18:46: moon altitude 0
