SUMMARY:Full Moon · Sydney Harbour Bridge from Blues Point Reserve · Moon
  on the arch of the Harbour Bridge
LOCATION:Blues Point Reserve\, Blues Point Road\, McMahons Point NSW 2060
GEO:-33.84966;151.20343
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=-33.84966,151.20343
DESCRIPTION:WHAT: The full moon sitting on the top of the Harbour Bridge ar
 ch\, seen from Blues Point. The exact pin is within metres of the reserve'
